                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a4783c36-7d6f-3fe3-af68-4cebff96f160",
                        "entry_id": "366eb8ad-8e97-3552-aa32-9edb67774c61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "joke, anecdote (funny or amusing story)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "colloquial"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "72d02a25-f196-4a31-a837-76474d270bf3",
                                "sense_id": "a4783c36-7d6f-3fe3-af68-4cebff96f160",
                                "text": "Читал вчерашнюю газету. Хохотал как безумный. Под некоторыми сообщениями так и хочется видеть подпись: Щедрин. Вот, например, письмо митрополита Антония к графине Толстой. Ну чем не щедринская хохма: «Есть слава человеческая и есть слава Божья»",
                                "translation": "I read yesterday's newspaper. Laughed like crazy. Under some messages you just wish to see the signature: Shchedrin. For example, the letter by Metropolitan Anthony to Countess Tolstoy. How is it not an anecdote by Shchedrin: “There is the glory of man and there is the glory of God.”",
                                "english": "I read yesterday's newspaper. Laughed like crazy. Under some messages you just wish to see the signature: Shchedrin. For example, the letter by Metropolitan Anthony to Countess Tolstoy. How is it not an anecdote by Shchedrin: “There is the glory of man and there is the glory of God.”"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "68626c46-654d-465a-ae66-e6f3ae79e92c",
                                "sense_id": "a4783c36-7d6f-3fe3-af68-4cebff96f160",
                                "text": "К моему удивлению, и у меня взяли кое-что «смешное», и так странно было слышать эту передачу из Москвы, эти слова и хохмы, придуманные здесь, в нашей маленькой редакции.",
                                "translation": "To my surprise, they took something “funny” from me, too, and it was so strange to hear this broadcast from Moscow, these words and anecdotes invented here in our small editorial office.",
                                "english": "To my surprise, they took something “funny” from me, too, and it was so strange to hear this broadcast from Moscow, these words and anecdotes invented here in our small editorial office."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3c5a2d39-fdc7-495b-a1c4-0f18c5dd2e27",
                                "sense_id": "a4783c36-7d6f-3fe3-af68-4cebff96f160",
                                "text": "Вот хохма — не работают!",
                                "translation": "What a joke — they aren't working!",
                                "english": "What a joke — they aren't working!"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ab80684c-5453-31f4-8acf-5fc7d4aa28cc",
                        "entry_id": "366eb8ad-8e97-3552-aa32-9edb67774c61",
                        "glosses": [
                            "joke (something said or done for amusement and not in seriousness)"
                        ],
